# Content & SEO

## Sources of truth

- Services, case studies, blog, nav, team, testimonials under `src/content/`
- Site URL / brand constants: `src/constants/site.js`
- Meta + JSON-LD: `src/components/seo/`

## Publishing

- Case studies: `status: 'published' | 'hidden'` — hidden must not appear in grids, partners, industries proof, or sitemap
- Keep claims verifiable; do not invent logos or metrics

## SEO checklist per page

- `PageMeta` with title, description, `canonicalPath`
- One clear visible `h1`
- Update `public/sitemap.xml` when adding public routes/posts
